  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KANU | Coffee Production Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1557 total beneficiaries, 381 women, 390 youth. Cooperative Kanuratubonekure aims to increase its income and sales revenue by constructing drying hangars, collection centers, and procuring a van for transportation of their coffee to wholesalers.</narrative>
